/-!
# The cut points of `NWildcard::CCensorNode::AddItemSimple` (PLAN.md §M, M1)

The 13 cut points: the entry and where two ways meet. From each, the blocks up to the next cut points as one piece
(`W_*`, with its `Sp`, `c_*`): a block's straight-line code, then at its jump's exits the next block's condition, or `Q`
at a cut point or at an offset the proof does not go past (49, 86, 128, 199, 215, 269, 283, 338, 346; the `ret`). `Wt`
is the table of the cut points' conditions, `spAll` its `Sp`s, for `Seg.cfg`. Generated by `tools/blk_gen.py`.
-/
namespace FV7z.Ais
set_option linter.unusedVariables false
